      "content": "Given the parametric equations for the curve $~x=2+\\sqrt{\\cos{2t}}~$ and $~y=1-\\sqrt{\\sin{2t}}~$. Find $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ and $\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}$. Give your answer in the simplest form.",
